## 1. Live-cluster collision check (BEFORE any build/run)

  $ ps aux | grep 'k3sm server'
    _k3sm  ... /Library/k3sm/k3sm server --runtime runtimed --token <redacted>
  The installed launchd cluster is on the fixed acceptance-gate ports
  (apiserver :6444, kine :2379, scheduler :10259, controller-manager :10257)
